---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<BaseLayout title="Projects" description="Applied research, analytical tools and experiments in public value">
  <div class="section-page">
    <h1>Projects</h1>
    <p class="intro">Applied research, analytical tools and experiments focused on place, public value and better decision-making.</p>

    <div class="project-grid">
      <article class="project-card featured">
        <div class="card-topline">
          <span class="project-type">Full rapid evidence assessment</span>
          <span class="project-date">August 2026</span>
        </div>
        <h2><a href={`${base}projects/rewiring-the-state-evidence/`}>Rewiring the State: what does the evidence support?</a></h2>
        <p><strong>Conclusion:</strong> devolution is best understood as a conditional institution-building strategy—not an automatic route to growth or savings. Explore ten claims, cross-government overlaps and 39 appraised sources.</p>
        <div class="tags" aria-label="Topics">
          <span>Devolution</span>
          <span>Public value</span>
          <span>Institutional reform</span>
        </div>
        <a class="read-link" href={`${base}projects/rewiring-the-state-evidence/`}>Explore the assessment <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card featured">
        <div class="card-topline">
          <span class="project-type">Rapid evidence assessment</span>
          <span class="project-date">August 2026</span>
        </div>
        <h2><a href={`${base}projects/when-targeting-need-is-not-enough/`}>When targeting need is not enough</a></h2>
        <p><strong>Conclusion:</strong> need is an essential equity criterion, but not a complete allocation rule. Better targeting also tests the mechanism, readiness, additionality and expected value of the next pound.</p>
        <div class="tags" aria-label="Topics">
          <span>Place-based policy</span>
          <span>Public value</span>
          <span>Prevention</span>
        </div>
        <a class="read-link" href={`${base}projects/when-targeting-need-is-not-enough/`}>Read the project <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .section-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
  }

  .section-page h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
  }

  .intro {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .project-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .project-card {
    padding: 1.6rem;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border-radius: 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(20, 32, 51, 0.07);
  }

  .project-card.featured {
    border-top: 4px solid var(--accent);
  }

  .card-topline {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  .project-type {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 750;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .project-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.65rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .project-card h2 a,
  .read-link {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .project-card h2 a:hover,
  .read-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .project-card p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
  }

  .tags span {
    padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  .read-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-weight: 750;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .section-page {
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
    }

    .section-page h1 {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>
